Reference implementation (Python 3.12+):
```python
from bisect import insort
class OrderedKth:
    def __init__(self, values=()): self.values=sorted(values)
    def insert(self, value): insort(self.values, value)
    def kth_smallest(self, k):
        if not 1<=k<=len(self.values): raise IndexError("k out of range")
        return self.values[k-1]

s=OrderedKth([7,2,5]); s.insert(3); assert s.kth_smallest(2)==3
```

